		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γᾶρυς</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
			B.
			5.15
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			S.
			<u>Ichn.</u>
			65
		</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">υος</span>, ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>voice, speech</i>, <i><span class="en">
